---@field dimensionValue? gcp.toolresults_v1beta3.EnvironmentDimensionValueEntryList Dimension values describing the environment. Dimension values always consist of "Model", "Version", "Locale", and "Orientation". - In response: always set - In create request: always set - In update request: never set
