---@field title? string General title for the suggestion, in the user's language, without markup. Always set.
---@field longMessage? gcp.toolresults_v1beta3.SafeHtmlProto Message, in the user's language, explaining the suggestion, which may contain markup. Always set.
---@field shortMessage? gcp.toolresults_v1beta3.SafeHtmlProto Concise message, in the user's language, representing the suggestion, which may contain markup. Always set.
---@field secondaryPriority? number Relative importance of a suggestion as compared with other suggestions that have the same priority and category. This is a meaningless value that can be used to order suggestions that are in the same category and have the same priority. The larger values have higher priority (i.e., are more important). Optional.
---@field region? gcp.toolresults_v1beta3.RegionProto Region within the screenshot that is relevant to this suggestion. Optional.
---@field helpUrl? string Reference to a help center article concerning this type of suggestion. Always set.
---@field resourceName? string Reference to a view element, identified by its resource name, if it has one.
---@field pseudoResourceId? string A somewhat human readable identifier of the source view, if it does not have a resource_name. This is a path within the accessibility hierarchy, an element with resource name; similar to an XPath.
---@field screenId? string ID of the screen for the suggestion. It is used for getting the corresponding screenshot path. For example, screen_id "1" corresponds to "1.png" file in GCS. Always set.

